cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "GoldenMinute: shock-aware autonomous sidewalk AED delivery in MuJoCo"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Mondal
    given-names: Ishaan
version: 0.1.0
license: MIT
keywords:
  - robotics
  - MuJoCo
  - model predictive control
  - reinforcement learning
  - out-of-hospital cardiac arrest
  - AED delivery
abstract: >-
  A MuJoCo study of a four-wheel sidewalk rover that delivers an automated external defibrillator:
  a mechanically co-designed vehicle, physics-in-the-loop MPPI and domain-randomised PPO against
  classical navigation, and a clinical break-even analysis against ambulance and drone delivery.
  The problem statement originates from the NMIMS MPSTME MDRIIA 2026 course brief (Group 03).
